{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1145669-who-would-really-represent-the-void-engineers-efd-or-nsc","id":1145669,"title":"who would really represent the Void Engineers? EFD or NSC?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-30T17:01:18-07:00","id":1145669,"title":"who would really represent the Void Engineers? EFD or NSC?","content":"I'd like to hear what other people think about this.<br /> <br /> According to Void Engineers Revised, it says that the Earth Frontier Division is the de facto representative of the VEs. Apparently because they are the VEs that the other Conventions interact with the most.<br /> <br /> Now I could see this, but it appears that the Neutralization Specialist Corps also would have a lot of contact with other conventions, at least the NWO.<br /> <br /> I can the EFD having a lot of contact with the Progenitors now that the Progens are based in Yemaja, but honestly, it would seem that the NSC would also have a lot of contact with the other Cons too.<br /> <br /> Personally, it seems like the NSC has a better Public Relations team and also, there's no one better to represent you than the guy who just saved your ass from the ghost-demon-thing that just tried to destroy your construct and amalgam. Also, the NSC looks like it's got some solid people skills that allow its members to deal directly with the masses.<br /> <br /> Anyone have any thoughts they'd like to add.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-30T18:19:28-07:00","id":1145690,"title":"","content":"Given that all Conventions have central committees of old masters, I'd figure that the Void Engineers send whomever makes sense for the meeting. Void Engineers are explorers at heart and while some explorers are good at team-building, others stink at it. PR teams are different from those who personally interact with other decision makers.<br /> <br /> What needs to be achieved at the meeting and who is attending? That would be my starting point for who communicates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}